demark of Infocom, Inc.\nRelease 37 / Serial number 851003\n \nAnother routine day of drudgery aboard the Stellar Patrol Ship Feinstein. This morning's assignment for a certain lowly Ensign Seventh Class: scrubbing the filthy metal deck at the port end of Level Nine. With your Patrol-issue self-contained multi-purpose all-weather scrub brush you shine the floor with a diligence born of the knowledge that at any moment dreaded Ensign First Class Blather, the bane of your shipboard existence, could appear.\n \nDeck Nine\nThis is a featureless corridor similar to every other corridor on the ship. It curves away to starboard, and a gangway leads up. To port is the entrance to one of the ship's primary escape pods. The pod bulkhead is closed.\n \n> \n➤\n🎤\nPlanetfall\nA science fiction story\nBy Infocom\nMap controls\nCenter\n-\n100%\n+\nMaps\nReset Map\n4 rooms / 4 exits / 0 notes\nIN\nUP\nNW\nN\nNE\nW\nDeck Nine\nE\nSW\nS\nSE\nDOWN\nOUT\nKNOWN ROOMS\nDeck NineEscape PodGangwayReactor Lobby\nNotes\nParchLock! build 72\nMenu","steps":[{"cmd":"W","reply":" Escape Pod This is one of the Feinstein's primary escape pods, for use in extreme emergencies. A mass of safety webbing, large enough to hold several dozen people, fills half the pod. The controls are entirely automated. The bulkhead leading out is open.   The pod door clangs shut as heavy explosions continue to buffet the Feinstein.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":231,"n":"escape pod bulkhead","before":{"n":"escape pod bulkhead","p":254,"c":0,"o":1,"a":1},"after":{"n":"escape pod bulkhead","p":254,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}},{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":235,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET IN WEB","reply":" You are now safely cushioned within the web.   You feel the pod begin to slide down its ejection tube as explosions shake the mother ship.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":215,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   Through the viewport of the pod you see the Feinstein dwindle as you head away. Bursts of light dot its hull. Suddenly, a huge explosion blows the Feinstein into tiny pieces, sending the escape pod tumbling away!    As the escape pod tumbles away from the former location of the Feinstein, its gyroscopes whine. The pod slowly stops tumbling. Lights on the control panel blink furiously as the autopilot searches for a reasonable destination.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The auxiliary rockets fire briefly, and a nearby planet swings into view through the port. It appears to be almost entirely ocean, with just a few visible islands and an unusually small polar ice cap. A moment later, the system's sun swings into view, and the viewport polarizes into a featureless black rectangle.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The main thrusters fire a long, gentle burst. A monotonic voice issues from the control panel. \"Approaching planet...human-habitable.\"   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The pod is buffeted as it enters the planet's atmosphere.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   You feel the temperature begin to rise, and the pod's climate control system roars as it labors to compensate.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The viewport suddenly becomes transparent again, giving you a view of endless ocean below. The lights on the control panel flash madly as the pod's computer searches for a suitable landing site. The thrusters fire long and hard, slowing the pod's descent.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The pod is now approaching the closer of a pair of islands. It appears to be surrounded by sheer cliffs rising from the water, and is topped by a wide plateau. The plateau seems to be covered by a sprawling complex of buildings.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   The pod lands with a thud. Through the viewport you can see a rocky cleft and some water below. The pod rocks gently back and forth as if it was precariously balanced. A previously unseen panel slides open, revealing some emergency provisions, including a survival kit and a towel.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":213,"n":"survival kit","before":{"n":"survival kit","p":0,"c":1,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"survival kit","p":216,"c":1,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":214,"n":"towel","before":{"n":"towel","p":0,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"towel","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":" Time passes...   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"GET OUT OF WEB","reply":" As you stand, the pod shifts slightly and you feel it falling. A moment later, the fall stops with a shock, and you see water rising past the viewport.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":215,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET KIT","reply":" Taken.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":213,"n":"survival kit","before":{"n":"survival kit","p":216,"c":1,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"survival kit","p":236,"c":1,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"OPEN DOOR","reply":" The bulkhead opens and cold ocean water rushes in!   The pod is now completely submerged, and you feel it smash against underwater rocks. Bubbles streaming upward past the window indicate that the pod is continuing to sink.   > ","room":216,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":231,"n":"escape pod bulkhead","before":{"n":"escape pod bulkhead","p":254,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"escape pod bulkhead","p":254,"c":0,"o":1,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"OUT","reply":" Underwater You are momentarily disoriented as you enter the turbulent waters. Currents buffet you against the sharp rocks of an underwater cliff. A dim light filters down from above.   > ","room":195,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":195,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"U","reply":" Crag You have reached a cleft in the cliff wall where the island rises from the water. The edge of the cleft displays recently exposed rock where it collapsed under the weight of the escape pod. About two meters below, turbulent waters swirl against sharp rocks. A small structure clings to the face of the cliff about eight meters above you. Even an out-of-shape Ensign Seventh Class could probably climb up to it.   > ","room":194,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":195,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":194,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"U","reply":" Balcony This is an octagonal room, half carved into and half built out from the cliff wall. Through the shattered windows which ring the outer wall you can see ocean to the horizon. A weathered metal plaque with barely readable lettering rests below the windows. The language seems to be a corrupt form of Galalingua. A steep stairway, roughly cut into the face of the cliff, leads upward. A rocky crag can be seen about eight meters below.   > ","room":193,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":194,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":193,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"U","reply":" Winding Stair The middle of a long, steep stairway carved into the face of a cliff.   > ","room":192,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":193,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":192,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"U","reply":" Courtyard You are in the courtyard of an ancient stone edifice, vaguely reminiscent of the castles you saw during your leave on Ramos Two. It has decayed to the point where it can probably be termed a ruin. Openings lead north and west, and a stairway downward is visible to the south.    > ","room":191,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":192,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":191,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Plain Hall This is a featureless hall leading north and south. Although the hallway is old and dusty, the construction is of a much more modern style than the castle to the south. A similar hall branches off to the northeast.   > ","room":189,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":191,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":189,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"NE","reply":" Rec Corridor This is a wide, east-west hallway. Portals lead north and south, and another corridor branches southwest.   > ","room":183,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":189,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":183,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"E","reply":" Mess Corridor This is a wide, east-west hallway with a large portal to the south. A small door to the north is closed and hooked with a simple steel padlock which is also closed.   > ","room":174,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":183,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":174,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"E","reply":" Dorm Corridor This is a wide, east-west hallway with openings to the north and south. To the east, the corridor stretches off into the distance. That section of the hallway is lined with a motorized walkway (no longer running) that was probably intended to transport people or cargo down that tremendously long hall.   > ","room":168,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":174,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":168,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"E","reply":" You walk down the long, featureless hallway for a long time. Finally, you see an intersection ahead...   Corridor Junction A north-south corridor intersects the main corridor here. To the west, the main corridor extends as far as you can see; a non-working walkway from that direction ends here. To the east, the corridor widens into a well-lit area.   > ","room":161,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":168,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":161,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Mech Corridor North Entrances to rooms lie to the east and west from this north-south hall.   > ","room":142,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":161,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":142,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Mech Corridor Entrances to rooms lie to the east and west from this north-south hall.   > ","room":141,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":142,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":141,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Mech Corridor South The corridor ends here with doorways to the southwest, south, and southeast.   > ","room":140,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":141,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":140,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"SW","reply":" Tool Room This is apparently a storage room for tools. Exits lead northeast and east. Sitting on the floor below the lowest shelf is a large glass flask. A small device, labelled \"Akmee Portabul Laazur\", is resting on one of the lower shelves. The laser contains:   An old battery On an upper shelf is a metal bar, curved into a U-shape. There is a pair of wide-nosed pliers here.   > ","room":126,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":140,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":126,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET BAR","reply":" Taken.   > ","room":126,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":124,"n":"curved metal bar","before":{"n":"curved metal bar","p":126,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"curved metal bar","p":236,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"NE","reply":" Mech Corridor South   > ","room":140,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":126,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":140,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Mech Corridor   > ","room":141,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":140,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":141,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Mech Corridor North   > ","room":142,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":141,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":142,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Corridor Junction   > ","room":161,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":142,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":161,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Admin Corridor South This section of hallway seems to have suffered some minor structural damage. The walls are cracked, and a jagged crevice crosses the floor. An opening leads east and the corridor heads north and south.   > ","room":160,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":236,"n":"player","before":{"n":"player","p":161,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"player","p":160,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"HOLD BAR OVER CREVICE","reply":" With a spray of dust and a loud clank, a piece of metal leaps from the crevice and affixes itself to the magnet. It is a steel key! With a tug, you remove the key from the magnet.   > ","room":160,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":158,"n":"key","before":{"n":"key","p":160,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"key","p":236,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"DROP BAR","reply":" Dropped.   > ","room":160,"player":236,"diff":[{"id":124,"n":"curved metal bar","before":{"